Short:    great FileList-Creator for AMMS
Uploader: Shadow@outside.in-berlin.de (Thomas Knuppe)
Author:   Cannon@outside.in-berlin.de (Ronny Schulz)
Type:     comm/bbs
Version:  2.20


-> Sorry, the documentation and most parts of this program are only in
   german. I think english versions are not so useful, because the BBS-
   system is german, too.

And now again: The first AMINET-release of my great FileList-creator for
a great BBS-System, called AMMS.

here are some features:

 - "night-scanning" for files
 - many settings, e.g. packer, scanmodes
 - fast
 - nice design (can be configured)
 - front and end-texts will be used
 - user-friendly interface
 - online-help
 - ...

